# DRAW keymap preset: Cosmigo Pro Motion NG (defaults - cosmigo.com/promotion/docs/onlinehelp/keyboardShortcuts.htm)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Pro Motion's own list is for a German keyboard: its previous / next colour (the ß and
#   ´ keys) and brush size (Shift with + / -) sit where a US keyboard has - and =, which
#   its zoom - / + already take as characters. So here zoom is - / + / =, and colour
#   stepping + brush size keep DRAW's keys ([ ] size; Palette menu for colour).
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): M marquee, R / Shift+R rectangle / filled,
#   C / Shift+C ellipse / filled, F fill, T text, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y undo / redo, Ctrl+C / X / V,
#   Ctrl+Shift+C copy merged, Ctrl+A / Ctrl+D select all / none, Ctrl+S save,
#   Ctrl+Shift+N new layer.
# Not in DRAW (no row): Alt+B freeform grab, Ctrl+M wand grab, Alt+N pan, Shift+T pick layer,
#   Shift+P symmetry centre, F4-F8 paint modes, W swap zoom, J spare frame, Shift+B
#   restore brush, Shift+Z resize brush, Shift+D single colour brush, A AnimBrush settings,
#   9 / 0 playback range, Ctrl+F frame delay, Ctrl+U / Ctrl+I undo / redo all, U full screen
#   (here: hide all UI), arrows move the canvas, Home / End jump to the borders.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: D dot (D = paint), S smart shapes (S = dotted), V move
#   (V = line), B brush (B = brush grab), L line (L = light table), E eraser (moves to F3),
#   X swap (moves to Shift+A), Z zoom tool, H flip, O bevel, G (grid chords still work),
#   , . grid size, 1 2 4-8 opacity, F2 F3 drawer modes, Ctrl+L layer panel, Ctrl+Shift+L
#   lock layout, Ctrl+T custom-font text, F11 stays too.

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
101 100 0 0     # D        paint (continuous)     -> Brush
101 15360 0 0   # F2       paint mode             -> Brush
102 115 0 0     # S        paint dotted           -> Dot
105 118 0 0     # V        line
2598 98 0 0     # B        rectangular brush grab -> Brush Selector
104 44 0 0      # ,        colour picker
8104 103 0 0    # G        grid snap              -> Snap to Grid
8007 103 2 0    # Shift+G  symmetry               -> Cycle Symmetry
1802 119 2 0    # Shift+W  crop                   -> Crop Canvas
117 101 0 0     # E        quick selection        -> Magic Wand
118 15616 0 0   # F3       erase mode             -> Eraser
325 116 1 0     # Ctrl+T   free transform         -> Transform: Scale

# --- Brush ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1112 122 0 0    # Z        rotate brush 90 CCW
1111 122 4 0    # Alt+Z    rotate brush 90 CW
1105 120 0 0    # X        mirror brush horizontally
1106 121 0 0    # Y        mirror brush vertically
1108 104 0 0    # H        halve brush
1107 104 2 0    # Shift+H  double brush
331 120 2 0     # Shift+X  double width
333 121 2 0     # Shift+Y  double height
1104 111 0 0    # O        border outside         -> Apply Outline
524 46 0 0      # .        single pixel brush     -> One-Pixel Brush
517 97 2 0      # Shift+A  swap foreground / second colour

# --- Frames / animation -------------------------------------------------------------------
2502 49 0 0     # 1        previous frame
2503 50 0 0     # 2        next frame
2501 33 0 0     # Shift+1 (!)  first frame
2504 64 0 0     # Shift+2 (@)  last frame
2595 52 0 0     # 4        loop forward           -> Play Looped
2596 53 0 0     # 5        play forward           -> Play Once
2597 54 0 0     # 6        ping-pong
2565 55 0 0     # 7        AnimBrush previous frame
2566 56 0 0     # 8        AnimBrush next frame
2567 38 0 0     # Shift+7 (&)  AnimBrush first frame
2514 20992 0 0  # Insert   insert copy            -> Duplicate Frame
2515 21248 1 0  # Ctrl+Delete  delete frame
2519 108 0 0    # L        light table            -> Lightbox

# --- Files / view -----------------------------------------------------------------------
206 108 1 0     # Ctrl+L        load project       -> Open Project (.draw)
201 111 1 0     # Ctrl+O        (DRAW's own key, kept)
201 108 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+L  load image         -> Open Image
403 34048 0 0   # F11           (DRAW's own key, kept)
403 117 0 0     # U             full screen        -> Toggle All UI
405 48 1 0      # Ctrl+0        (DRAW's own key, kept)
405 49 1 0      # Ctrl+1        zoom 1:1           -> Reset Zoom
406 43 0 0      # +        zoom in
406 61 0 0      # =        zoom in (+ without Shift)
407 45 0 0      # -        zoom out
313 8 4 0       # Alt+Backspace   fill with first colour
314 8 1 0       # Ctrl+Backspace  fill with second colour
